dsh-speech-to-text-gigaam README · Install and prepare — no terminal required：Requires DSH with `@deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-voice-input-bundle` and Node 20.3+
(the DSH host supplies Node). Reserve **4 GB disk**, approximately **2 GB RAM**;
initial setup normally takes **3–20 minutes**, depending on the network and machine.
